     "day": "past",
     "t": 0,
     "text": "He was brought up in an economical manner, and had early to contribute to the family funds.  He was steady and persevering, and rose gradually from a situation in a wholesale warehouse to be a clerk in a City office, with a salary of £100 a year.",
